      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly heartbreak-inducing to feel like your wealth is preventing them from living peacefully, and please know that your presence is complicated by your illness, but it is not the same as being a source of their struggle. There is often a gap between your internal feelings of inadequacy and what your child actually experiences, as children cannot choose to see their parents in that state of grief or overwhelm. The fact that you are struggling with such profound guilt to protect them speaks volumes about your love, rather than evidence that you are making things harder. You are doing the best you can with the pain you carry, and that compassion is something only you have been able to bring to this life.",
